  <entry id="bɔŋanndo_147">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>bɔŋanndo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="bɔŋanndo_147_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>rencontre, réunion</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>meeting, encounter</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.2.1 Come together, form a group"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 15 occurrences, first EXO.19.3; Keita 1979, p. 148: Bönhanndo; Childs 2000, p. 28: bɔ̀ŋâŋndó</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="bɔɔ_148">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>bɔɔ</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="o"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <field type="plural"><form lang="kqs"><text>bɛ́ɛ̀lan</text></form></field>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>bɛ́ɛ̀</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="bɔɔ_148_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>concession, cour</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>compound, courtyard</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="6.5.1 Building"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.6.7 Region"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>compound of a patrilineal lineage; yard around a house</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 833 occurrences, first GEN.1.16; Keita 1979, p. 142: Böö; Childs 2000, p. 19: bíɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Dans la Bible, la cour se dit bɛ́ɛ̀ (forme radicale, Mt 26,58 ; Jr 32,2), pluriel bɛ́ɛ̀lan, comme bíɔ̀ɔ́ / bɛ́ɛ̀láŋ chez Childs. La forme pleine bɔɔ suit Keita ; dans la Bible, bɔɔ seul a surtout d'autres sens (grand, buisson).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="bɔɔbɔɔyɛi_149">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>bɔɔbɔɔyɛi</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="i"/>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="bɔɔbɔɔyɛi_149_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>gloire, majesté</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>glory, majesty</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.5.6 Status"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.9.1 God"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 49 occurrences, first EXO.15.7</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="bɔɔle_150">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>bɔɔle</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <sense id="bɔɔle_150_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Adverb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>peut-être</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>perhaps</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="9.2.2 Adverbs"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 81 occurrences, first GEN.16.2</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="bɔɔlen_151">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>bɔɔlen</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="noun-class" value="len"/>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <field type="plural"><form lang="kqs"><text>bɔɔlan</text></form></field>
    <sense id="bɔɔlen_151_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Noun"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>plume</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>feather</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="1.6.2 Parts of an animal"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>feather; hem of cloth</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Keita 1979, p. 136: Böölen; Childs 2000, p. 29: bɔ̀ɔ̀léŋ</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Le singulier n'est pas dans la Bible ; le pluriel bɔɔlan y désigne les plumes et les ailes (LEV.1.16, LEV.11.20).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="bɔɔluuo_152">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>bɔɔluuo</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>bɔɔluu</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="bɔɔluuo_152_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>faire du bruit, gronder ; bruit, tumulte</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>make noise, roar; noise, uproar</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="2.3.2 Hear"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 4 occurrences, first ISA.17.12; Childs 2000, p. 29: bɔ̀ɔ̀lùùwó</text></form></note>
