    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>that (o class); also the default demonstrative for other classes</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 9758 occurrences, first GEN.1.4; Childs 2000, p. 176: kòŋ</text></form></note>
