      <gloss lang="en"><text>bed, couch; (kpele lɔaa n'mallo) threshing floor</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.1.1 Furniture"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="5.7 Sleep"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>bed; also a part of a rice field flattened by harvest or rain</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 10 occurrences, first 1SA.19.13; Childs 2000, p. 209: kpèlòó</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>o kpelela lɔaa n'maltan coo « sur les aires » (1 S 23,1).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
