      <gloss lang="en"><text>be good, beautiful, pleasing; goodness, beauty</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="8.3.7 Good"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>be good, fine, beautiful; be generous, morally good</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 170 occurrences, first GEN.2.12; Childs 2000, p. 259: nàŋɔ̀ɔ́</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>naŋ kɔl a … « aimer, apprécier » (1 S 18,5).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
