  <entry id="nuufiaa_1215">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>nuufiaa</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="respelled"/>
    <sense id="nuufiaa_1215_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>chercher</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>search, look for</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.6.1 Search"/>
    </sense>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>Keita 1979, p. 113: Nuufiaa</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>Pluriel de nuufaa.</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="nuvali_1216">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>nuvali</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>nuvalio</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="nuvali_1216_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Interjection"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>merci, bravo (pour un travail) ; (yil … nuvalio) remercier, féliciter</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>thank you, well done (for work); (yil … nuvalio) thank, congratulate</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="4.3.7 Polite"/>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="9.2.7 Interjections"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>thank you, especially for work someone has done</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 6 occurrences, first RUT.2.4; Childs 2000, p. 266: núwálí</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>La nuvali a vallo ! « merci pour votre travail ! » (salutation de Booz aux moissonneurs, Rt 2,4) ; Nuvali, vana baala kɛndɔɔ « c'est bien, bon serviteur » (Mt 25,21) ; mí yil Mɛlɛka nuvalio « je remerciai le Seigneur » (Gn 24,48).</text></form></note>
  </entry>
  <entry id="nuwviaa_1217">
    <lexical-unit><form lang="kqs"><text>nuwviaa</text></form></lexical-unit>
    <trait name="status" value="attested"/>
    <variant><form lang="kqs"><text>nuwviaanin</text></form></variant>
    <sense id="nuwviaa_1217_s1">
      <grammatical-info value="Verb"/>
      <gloss lang="fr"><text>chercher ; pourvoir</text></gloss>
      <gloss lang="en"><text>seek, look for; provide</text></gloss>
      <trait name="semantic-domain-ddp4" value="7.6.1 Search"/>
    </sense>
    <field type="southern-kissi-sense"><form lang="en"><text>plural of nùùwàá 'look for': search, seek</text></form></field>
    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 363 occurrences, first GEN.26.22; Childs 2000, p. 266: nùùwìá</text></form></note>
  </entry>
