    <note type="source"><form lang="en"><text>BKG: 40 occurrences, first GEN.41.8; Childs 2000, p. 400: yàwàá</text></form></note>
    <note><form lang="fr"><text>yavalan vomɔɔ « pratiquer la divination » (2KI.21.6).</text></form></note>
